OL,3,GNEWSAWoman dies and man arrested after
OL,4,Acollision
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman died and a man arrested
OL,7,Ffollowing a collision in Shropshire.
OL,9,FAn Alfa Romeo was involved in a
OL,10,Fcollision with a Mercedes on the A41
OL,11,Fnear Hinstock, Shropshire, at about
OL,12,F18:00 BST on Friday, West Mercia Police
OL,13,Fsaid.
OL,15,FThe Alfa Romeo driver, a woman in her
OL,16,F70s, was taken to hospital with
OL,17,Flife-threatening injuries. Sadly, she
OL,18,Flater died. Two people travelling in
OL,19,Fthe Mercedes suffered minor injuries
OL,20,Fand went to hospital as a precaution.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
